    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald O Donovan offer an unique opportunity to purchase The Old Train House Station Road Ballyhooly. The house comprises of a 6 bedroom two storey residence extending to an impressive 3,300 sq. ft. sitting on 0.77 of an acre of mature site. The property is steeped in history and character and once formed part of the Ballyhooly railway station until the last train passed through the property in 1968. Original features remain today including the original limestone walls, exposed timber beams and the original signal box located in the garden on the eastern boundary. The spacious living accommodation incorporates 5 ensuite bedrooms at first floor level, spacious kitchen/dining area and a 750 sq. ft. attached garage which could be further developed as living accommodation or recreational space. PVC solar panels have recently been installed increasing the energy efficiency of the building The original platform of cut limestone is still in situ creating a split level garden with a variety of mature trees and shrubs and benefits from a south facing rear garden with superb countryside views. There is also a secluded patio area located to the rear of the property . The Old Train House is located less than 1km from the village of Ballyhooly which has an excellent range of village amenities and approximately 10 mins to the local town of Fermoy and within easy commuting distance of Mallow town and Cork city."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.7m x 2m\nRadiator.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 9m x 4m\nVinyl floor covering. Wall and floor units. Breakfast bar. Radiator. Exposed cut stone and door leading to rear garden.\n\nUtility Room - 2.7m x 2.3m\nVinyl floor covering. Plumbed for washing machine and dryer. Storage presses.\n\nGuest Wc - 2.3m x 1.3m\nVinyl floor covering. Wc., whb. and power shower.\n\nSitting Room - 4mx 3.8m\nVinyl flooring. Radiator.\n\nPrimary Bedroom - 4m x 4m\nLaminate flooring. Radiator.\n\nWalk in Wardrobe - 2.5m 1.4m\nCarpet flooring\n\nEnsuite - 4m x 1.9m\nTiled floor to ceiling. Wc., whb., bath with overhead electric shower. Radiator.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.37m x 3.2m\nLaminate flooring. Radiator. Exposed timber beams.\n\nEnsuite - 3.1m x 0.8m\nVinyl floor covering. Wc., whb. electric shower.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4m x 3.3m\nVinyl flooring. Radiator.\n\nEnsuite - 2.7m x 1m\nTiled floor. Partially tiled walls. Wc., whb and electric shower. Radiator.\n\nBedroom 4 - 4m x 4.6m\nVinyl flooring. Radiator. Exposed timber beams.\n\nEnsuite - 2.5m x 0.8m\nVinyl flooring. Wc., whb.\n\nBedroom 5 - 5m x 3m\nVinyl flooring. Radiator.\n\nEnsuite - 2m x 1.4m\nTiled flooring. Wc., whb., electric shower.\n\nBedroom 6 - 4m x 3.9m\nVinyl flooring. Radiator. Exposed timber beams.\n\nPlay Room/Home Office - 4.3m x 2.5m\nRadiator\n\nGarage - 8.7m x 7.3m\n\n\n"
